    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1722870/extras/bbd3ad75627ac72e28e3e93108df4770.avif?t=1752868817\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1722870/extras/ccb9ca56bdf462603ffa6639115d2fe5.avif?t=1752868817\" /></div><br><i>Clank!</i>, the iconic deck-building board game adventure, challenges daring thieves to sneak into a dragon\u2019s lair, steal one of her precious artifacts, and escape \u2013 before you\u2019re roasted to a crisp!<br><br>Winning fans and awards around the world, <i>Clank!</i> is one of the most-beloved modern board games, with a wide range of expansions and adaptations for players to enjoy.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1722870/extras/c9e394e04b92d427fb10b40dc85873ce.avif?t=1752868817\" /></div><br>The deeper you go, the more valuable treasures you\u2019ll find\u2026but the harder it will be to escape! So be quick and be quiet: One false step and \u2013 <i>CLANK!</i> Each careless sound risks drawing the dragon\u2019s attention.<br><br>You\u2019re competing against your fellow thieves to claim the most valuable prize\u2026but you can only enjoy your loot if you make it out of the depths alive!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1722870/extras/1275ac5f06dafc1eb947df8a80428a13.avif?t=1752868817\" /></div><br>You\u2019ll need a good pair of boots, a sharp sword, and all your roguish skills to survive in the dungeon. Along the way, you\u2019ll acquire new items, abilities, and allies that will help you achieve victory!<br><br>Blending deck-building and exploration, <i>Clank!</i> offers a unique dungeon-delving adventure each time you play.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1722870/extras/f96bd21c05066de2c78ccbf52a378695.avif?t=1752868817\" /></div><br>Learn the ropes in a guided Tutorial, then hone your abilities by collecting Achievements and completing Challenges. Play cross-platform against friends, or compete in exciting new Heists that put you up against players from around the world!<br><br>However you choose to enter the dungeon: Good luck!...you\u2019re going to need it!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1722870/extras/bc0194a9cc4b8cd93368511a5a925793.avif?t=1752868817\" /></div>",
