\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1722870/extras/f96bd21c05066de2c78ccbf52a378695.avif?t=1752868817\" /></div><br>Learn the ropes in a guided Tutorial, then hone your abilities by collecting Achievements and completing Challenges. Play cross-platform against friends, or compete in exciting new Heists that put you up against players from around the world!<br><br>However you choose to enter the dungeon: Good luck!...you\u2019re going to need it!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1722870/extras/bc0194a9cc4b8cd93368511a5a925793.avif?t=1752868817\" /></div>",
