    "reviews": "\u201cWe're not kidding when we say this is probably the best deckbuilding game we've ever played.\u201d<br>Man Vs. Meeple<br><br>\u201cAnyone that knows me knows I love deck-building games, and Clank!? I love this game. I love this game so much I have every expansion for it.\u201d<br>ProZD<br><br>\u201cClank! has quickly earned a place in my collection as not only one of my favorite deck-builders, but flat out one of my favorite games.\u201d<br>Meeple Mountain<br>",
